{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人黃翠如昨日（23日）45歲生日，生日在馬來西亞度過，更開心獲好友送上驚喜生日P，友人悉出的派對片中，見翠如拿着酒杯開心碰杯，高呼：「我愛你哋呀！</p><p>」笑得十分開心，原來這是馬來西亞視后吳天瑜的精心安排，給翠如炮製驚喜。</p><p>翠如和吳天瑜是多年閨密</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T05:22:40.267230+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T05:01:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T05:18:12.790994+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T05:18:12.790994+00:00","content_hash":"e79b26c1c16828aad11a52dc170fabba0bfc0f4207bd193ec7a924ae2933a8a5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}